cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "Distribution-Free Calibrated Uncertainty for Pore-Scale Petrophysical Property Prediction via Conformal Prediction"
abstract: >
  Conformal prediction applied to three-dimensional CNN prediction of
  log-permeability and porosity from micro-CT porous-media volumes, providing
  prediction intervals with finite-sample distribution-free coverage guarantees.
